<title>USA: American Brands seeks U.K. Gallaher listing.</title>
<headline>American Brands seeks U.K. Gallaher listing.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Brands Inc, following its announcement Tuesday that it will spin off its U.K.-based Gallaher tobacco operations, will make an application to list Gallaher's shares on the London Stock Exchange, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>American Brands plans to change its name to Fortune Brands after the spinoff.  U.S. stockholders in Fortune Brands will be represented by the old American Brands shares, according to Tony Diaz, spokesman for American Brands.</p>
<p>The U.S. shareholders will get American Depository Receipts (ADR) for Gallaher, Diaz said.</p>
<p>The listing will come in six to 10 months, the timeframe expected for the completion of the spinoff, Diaz said.</p>
<p>--C. Thompson  New York Equities Desk (212) 859-1610</p>
